:: 2TrainObservationBase {"position":"650,2300","size":"100,100"}
Maybe it's your perception. Maybe it's the train itself. But this habitat flows more dynamically. Families move in and out. The scenery between stops are different. Something is different. Not like //''The Streak''//. It's just different...

A lion fitted with dark suit, red striped tie, and portfolio brief bag sits at the edge of the seating to your right. Something about her strikes you as familiar but you don't know what. She's confident though. Emenating power.

On the opposite side, to your left, an otter in a much shabbier suit ties his tie, paws shaking, with his laptop haphazardly open, about to slip off his lap. 

Parallel to you, in the far, far, right corner, another rat! He seems to be much more at ease than you, sitting, with a couple more of those sexy brown bottles you saw on the previous train. Maybe he'll share some with you.
(set:$morale to 3) (set:$status to "Inquisitive")
[[Approach the familiar figure->lionChoice]]
[[Become the otter's therapist->otterChoice]]
[[Cahoot with the other rat->ratChoice]]


:: 2TrainSuccessChoice {"position":"475,2175","size":"100,100"}
Your roll: (random:18,20)

//"Stand clear of the closing doors please"//

//Bing//

//''FWIIIIISSHHH''//

//Bong//

You've made it. The police lost you. This wasn't part of //''The Streak''//. But, for some reason, it's more delightful. 

Still. You're still a rat. You don't know who you are. You don't know how you got here. Rattiness is a mindset. 

[[Take a seat and think->2TrainObservationBase]]






:: ObservationBase {"position":"775,850","size":"100,100"}
This train car is a literal zoo. No humans to be found. Various species from the animal kingdom lie here: the proud lion on her way to deliver a presentation, the sly snake salesman, on his way to canal street, and you, the rat. 

In the bottom corner of the disabled seating area you see brown, glass bottles, with a little bit of their enchanting liquor left. A loud group of teen hyenas are chatting on their phones, occasionally looking at you, and then back down to their phones, and cackle in unison. One holds a vape in his hand. One holds a skateboard in his hand. And the other is just living in the moment, only a phone in hand.

The 70/30 ratio of piss and janitor soap eminates from the ground, which you've become numb to. What will you do? 
(set:$diceRoll to (random:1,20))
[[Wait, sorry, who am I?->identifyChoice]]
(if:$identifyBool)[[[Talk to the hyenas->hyenaChoice]]
][[Analyze the bottles->beerChoice]]
[[I want to attempt a cartwheel! (D15)->cartwheelChoice]]


:: Start {"position":"700,350","size":"100,100"}
The color is black. A mix of drowsiness and nausea fight for first place in your god-forsaken mind. It's your choice. Risk seeing what's out there, or simply lay flat, practically dead.

[[Lay flat->deadChoice]]
[[Open eyes->openEyeChoice]]


:: Transition {"position":"525,850","size":"100,100"}
Stops pass by at the blink of an eye. But where are we going? Why are we here? When do we get off? When will the illusion break? The streak.


:: alrightChoice {"position":"1250,2600","size":"100,100"}
The Otter looks at you in disbelief

"How could it ever be alright? I was doing so well *sniff* everything was perfect. I doubt I'll ever recover"

[["Soo, what seems to be the issue"->issueChoice]]
[["Just become a rat like me"->becomeRatChoice]]


:: arrestChoice {"position":"475,1875","size":"100,100"}
The cops pin you down and put you in handcuffs. You go on to spend the rest of the next 15 years in prison. This was never part of //''The Streak''//. You've managed to find something worse than being a rat. At least a rat would've preserved their sanctuary. You've managed to fail that too.

The End.

[[Go back in time a little->ObservationBase]]


:: backstoryChoice {"position":"400,3550","size":"100,100"}
The last slide: 

''Region | Q3 Revenue''
Northeast |// $842,000//
Southeast | //$731,000//
Midwest |// $614,000//
West | //$923,000//
Total | //$3,100,000//

A member of the client company raises their hand in the crowd:

"Doesn't this add up to $3,110,000?"

//Flashback over//

(set:$status to "Flummoxed") (set:$morale to -1)
[[Sit in silence->silentTrainChoiceIntro]]


