:: becomeRatChoice {"position":"975,2625","size":"100,100"}
You say: "//-burpppp-// The rat life is the apt life brochacho. No worries, no responsibility"

That did not come out how you imagined it in your head. You also half believe what you are saying. Maybe it's sobering up. Maybe //''The Streak''// matters less? Maybe it's a combination of both. 

Stop thinking. You're meant to be Mr.Otter's therapist. It doesn't seem like this made him feel any better.

"Well *sniffs* I don't really want to be a rat like you. I've got, or maybe at this point *sniffs* had a future ahead of me"

[["Well fuck you then!" *walks off, preserving self dignity*->2TrainObservationBase]]
[["What is making these tears fall out of your eyes?"->issueChoice]]


:: beerChatChoice {"position":"325,2550","size":"100,100"}
//"Yes mate! I've been scouring for some drinking buddies and it looks like my -*burp*- prayers have been answered"//

He hands you a beer, smile on mouth, excited that someone like him exists out in this world. 

[[Take the beer and drink to your hearts content->drunkChoice]]
[[Decline the beer, remembering what happened the last time you drank->2TrainObservationBase]]


:: beerChoice {"position":"650,975","size":"100,100"}
The sweet smell of liquor calls you. You can fully forget about //''The Streak<sup>tm</sup>''//. It doesn't matter anymore. A siren, laying on its stage (in this case the gunky subway floor), the beer wraps its temptation around you. You clumsily puppeteer your limbs to greet Mr. Beer with a firm handshake. 

(set:$status to "Horny for Beer")
(set:$diceRoll to (random: 1,20))
[[Smell it->smellBeerChoice]]
[[Take a filthy swig of it you animal->chugBeerChoice]]
[[Escape it's clutches <span title="This means that if you were to roll a 20 sided dice, you would have to roll a 10 or above to get a success" style="color:red">(D10)</span>->escapeChoice]]


:: cTrainFulton {"position":"500,3125","size":"100,100"}
//*"This is, Fulton St Station. Transfer is available to the 2; 3; 4; 5; and J trains. This is an accessible station"*//

The Otter hunches off, probably off to meekly hand in his presentation. The Lion struts off, probably on her way to boss more of your fellow employees. Before the doors close she looks back to you:

"Next time don't fuck *it* up or else it's the real end for you"

//Bing//
//Bong//

The doors become airtight. What's *it*? What did you do at Mckinsey & Company? 

[[Ruminate even harder. Tap into your deepest memories to find your greatest mistake. Close your eyes (D16)->memoryFlashback]]


:: cartwheelChoice {"position":"1150,975","size":"100,100"}
Your roll: $diceRoll

Your hands are in the air, rays poking out from your fingers as you line up the preliminary //cart// to the //wheel//. 

(if:$diceRoll > 15)[//*SLAP, SLAP, THUNK*//. You did it. You did the cartwheel. The crowd watches in awe. You sir, are a champion. Now take a victory lap, and head back to your seat to figure out why you're here.](else:)[//*SLAP, SLIP, THUNK*//. You failed. This feeling is all too familiar now. Just keep your wits about you and head back to your seat.]

[[Head back to your seat->policeChase]]


:: chugBeerChoice {"position":"275,1175","size":"100,100"}
Even though you've already passed the subway stop for the //''The Streak<sup>tm</sup>''//, you couldn't care less. The inflation of balloons of forgetfulness leech your mind, and before you know it, this episode of your life fades to black.
(set:$status to "More drunk than when you started")
[[//''Allow time to pass in the infinite expanse''//->Start]]


:: confusedChoice {"position":"1000,2775","size":"100,100"}
The river streaming down his face stops all of a sudden. He looks at you, and back down at his computer, and back at you.

"What the fuck are you even saying"

He is genuinely confused by your passionate words of wisdom. But you, the therapist, have done you job right. He's not crying anymore.
(set:$otterEnd to true)
(if: $nameEnd and $otterEnd and $singEnd)[[[//Whisper to yourself "mission complete"//->2TrainObservationBase]]](else:)[[[//Whisper to yourself "mission complete"//->cTrainFulton]]]


:: coolLineChoice {"position":"700,1725","size":"100,100"}
Your roll: $diceRoll

You prepare your vocal cords.

(if:$diceRoll > 12)[(set:$status to "Cool, Calm, and Collected")(set: $morale to $morale + 2)"'Tis but a scratch." Nailed it. All the beat up teenagers heard it. All the passengers who watched the fight in horror also heard it. Welcome my friend back to: //''The Streak''//. Nothing will stop you this time.](else:)[(set:$morale to $morale - 1)(set:$status to "Embarassed")"I have a butt scratch to itch." Fuck. You're simply too drunk to even get out a simple sentence correctly. You just beat up some teenagers to mess up your finishing line. Go back to your seat, and focus on the real mission at hand here.]

[[Go back to rediscovering your origin story->policeChase]]


:: correctFightChoice {"position":"900,1450","size":"100,100"}
//*FWOOSH*//

You weave the first swing from Hyena Vape-Teen and wind up the haymaker...

//*THUNK*//

You clock Hyena Vape-Teen in the cheek. A tooth flies out, a prize for your fighting abilities. But Hyena Skate-Teen looks like they're about to swing with their skateboard in hand, a possible deadly blow. 

[[Duck and trip Hyena 2->duckTripChoice]]
[[Run away->policeChase]]


:: crawlChoice {"position":"1100,1400","size":"100,100"}
You crawl up in a ball and tears start flowing down your cheeks and whiskers. 

"OH MY GOD, A RANDOM TWEAKER TRIED TO PICK A FIGHT WITH US AND GOT TOO SCARED"

A Green Apple flavored vape cloud hurls itself towards your face.

No fight, no guts, you truly are a rat. Might as well just close your eyes, and sleep for the next eternity.

[[Close your eyes->Start]]
[[//''Prove your guts''//->fightChoice]]


:: deadChoice {"position":"500,450","size":"100,100"}
Silence. It's the one language that you can comprehend. Not impressed, not disappointing. The white bread of experiences. 

[[Continue to lie down->deadChoiceAlt]]
[[Open your eyes->openEyeChoice]]


:: deadChoiceAlt {"position":"450,575","size":"100,100"}
Occassional rumbles, you're like a celestial body. This is what the dead planets and quarks will experience after the heat death of the universe. You're just getting a preview.

[[Continue to lay down->deadChoice]]
[[Open your eyes->openEyeChoice]] 


:: dogTrainChoice {"position":"400,4225","size":"100,100"}
''//What//''

//''No-''//

//BING//
//BONG//

Oh my god. The cutest dog you've ever seen walks onto the train. Not your weird boozed anthropomorphic versions of it but an actual genuine puppy. It's body so fat but it keeps wagging it's tiny little tail, looking at you with its beady eyes and tongue hanging from the side of its mouth. 
(set:$morale to $morale + 3)
[[Pet it->petChoice]]


:: dontKnowChoice {"position":"25,2700","size":"100,100"}
"Mate what do you mean *you don't know?* What are you doing here ratting away then if you don't even know?" 
(set:$status to "Confused")
[["I don't know?" *looks back at rat*->ratChoice]]


:: dontKnowNameChoice {"position":"650,1125","size":"100,100"}
Shame on you! //''SHAME!''// This is the most important part of a human's origin story. This is why you're simply a rat. Rats don't get names. They just scuttle around without meaning in the infinite labyrinth of the subway tunnels, identifying themselves as the scuttlers of human waste. 
(set:$diceRoll to (random: 1,20))
[[No no no I can remember my name I promise! (D18)->nameAttempt]]
[[I give up->nameGiveUp]]


:: drunkChoice {"position":"400,2700","size":"100,100"}
The world around you turns woozy. Swirls and colors mold together in a both hypnotic and agitating dance. Time passes by in a vaccuum. The fellow rat's speech is going through one ear and out the other, but in your head what he's saying could from the mouth of a professor from Harvard.

You eyelids become heavier. You desire to explore the vast expanses of space. You want to be stuck on this train. 
(set:$status to "Super Drunk... Again")
[[*Close eyes*->Start]]


:: duckTripChoice {"position":"800,1575","size":"100,100"}
//*FWOOSH*//

They completely whiff. You whip your tail around their ankles to trip Hyena Skate-Teen. They fall over, hit their head, and sustain a concussion. You've won. Total victory. 

[[Celebrate the victory with a victory cartwheel! (D15)->victoryCartwheelChoice]]
[[Say a cool line like //"'Tis but a scratch"// (D12)->coolLineChoice]]
[[Walk away in silence, like a mature "adult"->walkAwayChoice]]


:: dumbChoice {"position":"825,2700","size":"100,100"}
"Wow Clint, I didn't think my opinion of you could get any lower. Hope you don't show up to the office like this or else you may not make it to the offsite." She grins.

Ugh. //Clint//. Something about that name irks you more than Ratbrain. But wait. She said that you work for the same company? Hopefully she didn't see you get chased down by the police. A deep regret of interaction washes over you, as you head back to your seat. 
(set:$status to "Inferior") (set:$morale to $morale - 1) (set:$name to "Clint")(set:$nameEnd to true)(set:$linkedin to "https://www.linkedin.com/in/clint-kratz-212302217/")
(if: $nameEnd and $otterEnd and $singEnd)[[[Sit back down in your seat->2TrainObservationBase]]](else:)[[[Sit back down in your seat->cTrainFulton]]]


:: endSongChoice {"position":"275,2975","size":"100,100"}
You both laugh as you sing through to the end of the song. No one in the train audience claps, probably because you are both horrendus at singing. Nonetheless the other rat looks at you afterward and gives you a warm, needed, hug, pats you on the back, and simply says:

"Thank you"
(set:$status to "Comfortable")
(if: $nameEnd and $otterEnd and $singEnd)[[[Go back to rumination->cTrainFulton]]](else:)[[Go back to rumination->2TrainObservationBase]]


:: endurePainChoice {"position":"425,3400","size":"100,100"}
Your Roll: $diceRoll

You reach into the deepest, darkest, depths of your brain. Stinging nettle of the memories irritate your claw. Your entity is being shredded, but you're getting close. Reach son. Reach.

[[*Reach*->reachMoreChoice]]


:: escapeChoice {"position":"400,1125","size":"100,100"}
Your Roll: $diceRoll ((if:$diceRoll>15)[Success](else:)[Utter Failure])

(if:$diceRoll >= 15)[Every fiber of your body has been given the directive to resist the sexy alcohol. You're able to successfully prevent another incident that might ruin "The Streak"<sup>tm</sup>] (else:)[You fail to convince yourself that giving up this beer is worth it and you start chugging your woes away.

