:: exitTrainChoice {"position":"350,4725","size":"100,100"}
Your Roll: (random:1,20)

**FLASH**

It's simply too much for you to comprehend. The un-plastic air. The smell of wind. The lack of LEDs. You've walked outside.

But the dog and dogwalker are quick on their feet, making pace to turn the corner at the block. 

[[Get your drunk ass up and follow->followChoice]]


:: failureHeadbuttFightChoice {"position":"650,1450","size":"100,100"}
You charge up your headbutt, to pull the most ferocious attack on the Hyena that insulted your age. 25 is not an old age. Maybe they're just too young. 

You fire off the headbutt. They see it from a mile away. They easily side step your attempt and you trip and faceplant into a metal support pole. You are now heavily concussed. 
(set:$status to "Heavily Concussed") (set:$morale to $morale - 1)
[[Standup and swing again->standUpChoice]]
[[Lay down and accept defeat->layDownChoice]]


:: failureWeaveFightChoice {"position":"775,1425","size":"100,100"}
You guessed wrong. You weave to your left and feel a sustained contact on the bone of your jaw. It's the truck of one of their skateboards. Your nausea feels like it just got a million times worse. Saliva flies out of your mouth, exhaling pain and suffering. You are heavily concussed. 
(set:$morale to $morale - 1) (set:$status to "Heavily Concussed")
[[Swing back->standUpChoice]]
[[Stay down->layDownChoice]] 


:: fightChoice {"position":"825,1275","size":"100,100"}
//*BANG*//

Your drunken strike lands clean on the chin of the Hyena that mocked your clothing choices. The other two square up, ready to swing their paws and skateboards at your delicate rat jaw. The Hyena holding a vape drops his vape. The tension is through the sewers. Things are beginning to get serious.

Hyena Vape-Teen winds up a punch

[[Weave left, counter with a quick right jab->failureWeaveFightChoice]]
[[Weave right, counter with a haymaker left->correctFightChoice]]
[[Swing your leg to trip->correctFightChoice]]
[[Attempt a tactical headbutt->failureHeadbuttFightChoice]]


:: followChoice {"position":"325,4850","size":"100,100"}
Your limbs begin to move. Your core has the integrity of a fresh jello. Fuck //''The Streak''//. You roll your way through Church Av, oncoming passerby's stiffly shuffling out the way.

[[Keep going!->keepFollowChoice]]


:: getHereChoice {"position":"850,2550","size":"100,100"}
"You applied for the job. You filled out your resume. You wrote a cover letter describing all the great things about McKinsey & Co. You took an interview in the war room. Are you even a real adult?"

You are both the same age.
(set:$status to "Inferior") (set:$morale to $morale - 1)
(if: $nameEnd and $otterEnd and $singEnd)[[[Talk about something else before you think you might get "fired"->lionChoice]]](else:)[[[Talk about something else before you think you might get "fired"->cTrainFulton]]]


:: goodEnd {"position":"325,5350","size":"100,100"}
THE END


