:: howIGotHereChoice {"position":"775,1125","size":"100,100"}
You have an origin story. You know it and feel it. A rat doesn't appear out of thin air in a subway car. It has to scuttle in somehow. You look around to find something, or someone that has led you in on this chase. You're unable to recognize much. But, the smell of the brown, glass, bottle in the corner sticks out in the sea of NYC musk. 

[[//continue//->ObservationBase]]
(set:$identifyBool to true)


:: hyenaAggroChoice {"position":"1025,1125","size":"100,100"}
They begin to mock you. 

"YO WHO DOES THIS OLD MAN THINK HE IS?"

You're 25. Or at least you think you are. 

"YOU'RE SO TOUGH HUH"

You never said that.

"YOU DRESS LIKE MY STEP-DAD"

Hurtful.
(set:$status to "Slightly Concussed")
[["Look you guys just hurt my feelings and I don't really think it's necessary-"->hyenaSwingChoice]]
[[//Walk away in shame//->shameChoice]]


:: hyenaChoice {"position":"975,950","size":"100,100"}
You got up to the group of Hyenas, and each of their gazes slowly fasten onto you. A rut is in your throat as you try to think of what to say to them, what to ask them, it feels like an impossible task. But. You have to try.

[["Hi I was wondering if you guys know how I got here?"->hyenaHowChoice]]
[["I would politely want to ask you guys to stop laughing at me"->hyenaPoliteChoice]]
[["Get the fuck off my train car before I send your asses to the shadow realm"->hyenaAggroChoice]]


:: hyenaHowChoice {"position":"1150,1125","size":"100,100"}
The young teens look at you. Look back at each other. Their mouths tighten. Their cheeks puff with anticipation. This is not good for you. And then an explosion of laughter hits.

"HEHHEHEHEHEHEHEHE" 

"YOUR JACKET AND TIE LOOK SO GOOFY"

He puffs a large vape cloud right in your face. Green apple flavored. 

"OMG HE ACTUALLY DOES LOOK LIKE A RAT"

Something about that insult feels familiar in a bad way. Laughter fills the train car. Anger for a past version of you bubbles up from the scum.

[[//Swing a punch on one of the teens//->fightChoice]]
[[//Accept your shame like a loser//->shameChoice]]


:: hyenaPoliteChoice {"position":"900,1125","size":"100,100"}
The young teens look at you. Look back at each other. Their mouths tighten. Their cheeks puff with anticipation. This is not good for you. And then an explosion of laughter hits.

"HEHHEHEHEHEHEHEHE" 

"YOUR JACKET AND TIE LOOK SO GOOFY"

He puffs a large vape cloud right in your face. Green apple flavored. 

"OMG HE ACTUALLY DOES LOOK LIKE A RAT"

Something about that insult feels familiar in a bad way. Laughter fills the train car. Anger for a past version of you bubbles up from the scum.

[[//Swing a punch on one of the teens//->fightChoice]]
[[//Accept your shame like a loser//->shameChoice]]


:: hyenaSwingChoice {"position":"1075,1250","size":"100,100"}
//*POW*//

A right hook hits the bottom of your jaw and rocks your head back. It's now or never. 

"OLD MAN NEXT TIME IT'S GONNA BE THE SKATEBOARD THAT DOES THE TALKING"

Forget about //''The Streak<sup>tm</sup>''// it's time for you get in on the action. This is your calling, your destiny to start a new //''The Streak<sup>tm</sup>''//. These teenagers need to experience the real world. (set:$status to "Deeply Concussed") (set:$morale to $morale - 1)

[[Crawl up in a ball and cry->crawlChoice]]
[[Fight back for your glory! *Swings punch*->fightChoice]] 


:: idChoice {"position":"725,2550","size":"100,100"}
"Ratbrain, what kind of question is that" 

Ugh. Ratbrain. That name irks your soul. And not just because you are a rat. Are they insulting you, or do they think that's your actual name? 

[["Are you insulting me or is that my name"->nameChoice]]
[["Ratbrain does not answer to an inferior"->dumbChoice]]


:: identifyChoice {"position":"775,975","size":"100,100"}
Your name is... you don't know. How could you forget your own name?

[[I don't know!->dontKnowNameChoice]]
[[Can I get at least how I got here?->howIGotHereChoice]]


:: issueChoice {"position":"1125,2625","size":"100,100"}
"*sniff* I completely fucked my powerpoint *sniff* I forgot to take out the placeholders and my manager is gonna kill me *sniff* I worked so hard to get here too, my life is overrrr *sobs*" 

His glasses almost fall off his snout and his computer lid closes shut. He's fully given up. You eyes also begin to well up. Something about this scenario feels a too familiar. 

[["Don't worry. //''The Streak''// is a false destiny. I know your potential isn't defined by what happens today->confusedChoice]]
[["Don't worry. //''The Streak''// isn't about success. Just embrace a different streak, and join us rats->confusedChoice]]



:: keepFollowChoice {"position":"325,4975","size":"100,100"}
Your cardio is starting to give out. But you keep trudging forward. The dog still looks behind at you but the dog walker is moving ground on you. You begin to fear if it's out of reach. I guess it'll be okay if it does. 

But the dogwalker stops. Right in front of a small apartment complex. They take off their shades and take out their airpods. As you catch your footing to get closer to the dog the dogwalker looks at you, your heights exactly even.

She hands the handle of the leash to you and opens the door, and then simply walks off with her airpods back in. 

[[Walk inside?->walkChoice]]


:: lanyardChoice {"position":"600,2550","size":"100,100"}
You eyes focus on the lanyard. It shimmers with prestige in the plastic lights of the train car. A clean, uninterrupted streak scopes diagonally across the lanyard canvas. You see the name: "Trisha Vanderbilt" in elegant seriffed font. //Mckinsey & Company// nonchalantly loiters in the bottom right corner. 

(if: $nameEnd and $otterEnd and $singEnd)[[[Look back at her eyeballs to signify that you are about to have a real and professional conversation->lionChoice]]](else:)[[[Look back at her eyeballs to signify that you are about to have a real and professional conversation->cTrainFulton]]]


:: layDownChoice {"position":"525,1575","size":"100,100"}
You lay down, heavily concussed from losing a fight. This would be a time when //''The Streak<sup>tm<sup>''// has fully ended. Your eyes begin to close, as you plan to rest on the ground, the teenagers now taking photos for their instagram story.

(if:$morale > 0)[[[Get back up, and stay in your own lane->policeChase]]](else:)[[[Close your eyes to enter the infinite, harmless expanse->Start]]]


:: lionChoice {"position":"650,2425","size":"100,100"}
The lion seems to have already noticed you before you noticed her. Blank eyes of will shine through though. You crave information, just anything. You want to break //''The Streak''//. You go up to her, knees shaking, body still sore, and ask:

[["Who am I?"->idChoice]]
[["How did I get here?"->getHereChoice]]
