:: reachFurtherChoice {"position":"325,5225","size":"100,100"}
You reach and reach, nothing there but void and des-

''//RUFF RUFFF RUFFF//''

The dog barks loudly and you hear the click of the lock on the door unfasten-

//''HAPPY BIRTHDAY CLINT!''//

It's your friends and family. They've decided to hold a birthday party for you: someone they deem special enough to hold it for. Your family lives across the country but flew out to see you. Your roommates let them in and set up the large frosted cake on the shabby dining table. You're 26 now, one year older than that //bitch// manager. Your ''//STREAK//'' of being 25 is now over, and you couldn't be happier.

[[Join your family (D0)->goodEnd]]


