Oh no. Your joy. Your life. Your risk. It's all going soon. The dogwalker tugs the leash a little. The dog still looks at you as it trots its little legs through the doors on its way out. You could either reach, risk leaving the train, or simply stay, and continue //''The Streak''//. The doors begin to close their shackles.
